                "content": "![Example 1](https://assets.leetcode.com/uploads/2020/09/28/all_1.jpg)\n\n```\nInput: graph = [[1,2],[3],[3],[]]\nOutput: [[0,1,3],[0,2,3]]\n```\n\n**Explanation:** There are two paths: `0 -> 1 -> 3` and `0 -> 2 -> 3`."
